{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35884","headline":"同友生题僧院杜鹃花 · 李咸用","name":"同友生题僧院杜鹃花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若比衆芳应有在，难同上品是中春。\n牡丹爲性疎南国，朱槿操心不满旬。\n留得却缘真达者，见来宁作独醒人。\n鹤林太盛今空地，莫放枝条出四邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}